      // bubble + [鎵ц]/[鍙栨秷] 鏍忥紙瀵归綈 chat_v2_plan handler 鐨勫瓧娈碉級銆?
      const _plan = msg.payload?.plan;
      if (_plan && _plan.awaiting) {
        store.push_message(target, {
